          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waawitaáwí an kudá' aa waawuti'in baraá yaamaá Edomuwo qoomár múk Israeli kuwa sawaawuti'inká: Bela garmoó Beori umuú gixsarós ar ur a Dinhaba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.1.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.1.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 1:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bela iwa gwaá', Yobabu garmoó Sera oo Bosra kitángw Bela guri óh. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.1.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.1.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 1:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Qoomár Yobabu iwa gwaá', Hushamu oo yaamaá Temi kitángw Yobabu guri óh. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.1.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.1.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 1:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hushamu iwa gwaá' Hadadi garmoó Bedadi kitángw Hushamu guri óh, inós múk Midiani guna baál baraá yaamaá Moabu wa ale, umuú gixsarós ar ur kuri báy Afiti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.1.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.1.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 1:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hadadi iwa gwaá', Samla oo yaamaá Masreka kitángw Hadadi guri óh. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.1.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.1.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 1:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Samla iri gwaá', Saulo oo yaamaá Rehoboti kuduú bihhaá yaaér Eufrate kitángw Samla guri óh. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.1.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.1.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 1:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Saulo iwa gwaá', Ba'al-hanani garmoó Akbori kitángw Saulo guri óh. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.1.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.1.49"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 1:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ba'al-hanani iwa gwaá', Hadadi kitángw Ba'al-hanani guri óh, umuú gixsarós ar ur a Pai, nee umuú harerós a Mehetabeli, dasír Matredi, dasír Mesahabu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.1.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.1.50"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
